<title>UK: Nickel bounces to end firm, most others end lower.</title>
<headline>Nickel bounces to end firm, most others end lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>NICKEL - Bounces in late trade, ends firm on Falconbridge strike vote.</p>
<p>COPPER - Slumps in late trade, ends weak.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Depressed by copper, closes soft.</p>
<p>LEAD - Quiet, ends lower. ZINC - Steadier, regains $1,460.</p>
<p>TIN - Finishes little changed. ALLOY - Dull/lower.</p>
</text>
